  "summary_zh": "車停在塞里雅蘭瀑布，從停車場走過來約 15 分鐘 800 公尺，這裡洞口很小，裡面也很小，通常要排隊，且裡面瀑布太近，會淋的一身溼，要留意一下。\n\n要走進來，洞口很小，需要要踏在溪水上的石頭，防水鞋子是一定要的，裡面洞口小，大概 10 個人就很擠了，想進來一看需要排隊。",
  "summary_en": "Park at Seljalandsfoss; it’s about a 15‑minute (800 m) walk from the lot. The entrance to Gljúfrabúi is very narrow and the cave inside is small, so queues are common. The waterfall is close enough to get you completely wet, so be prepared. To enter, you’ll need to step on wet stones in the stream, so waterproof shoes are essential. The space fills up quickly—around ten people can make it feel cramped—so expect to wait in line.",
